# (Into dng101b1 by the depart action with stag0101 matz00's target, alone in its stage group: the explore bot's k5
# characters fell on stag0101's rock slope on the way to matz00, both in round r2b.)
# W11, a (k5): alone in its own instance, takes stag0101's matz00 into dng101b1 where c's instance has a stage group:
# no prompt, a new stage group of a's own instance; a sees none of c's members (decision 41). a enters with
# DW4_ONLINE_AUTOCHOICE=new (its arrival is a New instance, not the automatic join of c's Public instance).
campaign until stage=stagml11,control
idle until epoch>=@100
explore mate00 yes until stage=stag0101,control
log a hosts
wander -150 -60 20 until frames>=600
depart dng101b1 0 until stage=dng101b1,control
log a in the cave
wander 0 0 30 until frames>=3000 fail present>=2
log a alone in its instance
